{"id":"steam-4416300","steam":4416300,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Yu-Gi-Oh! TAG FORCE GX","summary":"A new semester begins as fan-favorite RPG card game Yu-Gi-Oh! GX TAG FORCE 3 is reborn as Yu-Gi-Oh! TAG FORCE GX with modern visuals, enhanced Dueling, and nostalgic cards from the Yu-Gi-Oh! GX anime era. ","about":"Your final year at Duel Academy is officially underway!  Select your partner from over 100 visually upgraded characters and conquer your opponents as a Dueling duo! Strengthen your affinity with your classmates and build memories as you study the art of Tag Dueling and prepare for a Graduation Duel to remember! \r\n\r\nGet Your Game On! Classic Dueling is back and rebuilt with over 3,800 cards, including additional fan-favorite cards beyond those featured in the original Yu-Gi-Oh! GX TAG FORCE 3. Build your Deck, develop unique strategies, and enjoy student life at Duel Academy as you Duel your way to victory.\r\n\r\nYu-Gi-Oh! TAG FORCE GX marks the first-ever Americas debut of Yu-Gi-Oh! GX TAG FORCE 3 content, which was previously unreleased in North and Latin America.\r\n\r\n《New Features》\r\n・Unleash your inner HERO! Over 3,800 cards, including additional cards supporting GX-era Decks. \r\n・Class is in Session Explore, investigate and expand your extracurricular activities with new and renewed mini-games. \r\n・Duel the World Enter a Casual Duel or Room Match to enjoy both Tag and 1v1 Duels with Online Multiplayer!\r\n・Gallery Mode Reminisce with story scenes from Yu-Gi-Oh! GX TAG FORCE and Yu-Gi-Oh! GX TAG FORCE2.\r\n\r\n\\\r\n\"Yu-Gi-Oh!\" is a popular manga created by Kazuki Takahashi that was serialized in SHUEISHA Inc.'s \"WEEKLY SHONEN JUMP\" since 1996. Konami Digital Entertainment Co., Ltd. provides a Trading Card Game (TCG) and console games, based on \"Yu-Gi-Oh!\" created from the original manga, that has been enjoyed around the world.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416300/7e7d010be1e10551d